'''Gurglings''' are ordinary enemies that behave slightly differently from their [[Gurglings|boss]] counterparts. They have significantly less HP, leave a constant trail of [[Creep#Red Creep|Red Creep]], and after dashing, shoot out six blood projectiles instead of spawning [[Attack Fly|Attack Flies]].

