== Trivia ==
* Gurglings appear to be the first stage of the "Gurdy" boss line, with the second stage as {{e|Gurdy Jr.}}, third as {{e|Gurdy}}, and final as {{e|Mama Gurdy}}.
* If the Gurglings audio is slowed down or if one spawns as a [[Champions|large champion]], the audio reveals that it is a little kid saying "Rawr!"
* In the game files, a Gurgling's feet are called hands.

